rewrite_status_apache_heading#:#Apache
rewrite_status_apache_instructions#:#This file's own current content, shown for reference (you never paste it anywhere yourself once the one-time step above is in place). Apache only re-reads it on reload, not on every request, so reload it (e.g. apache2ctl graceful) whenever this content changes, including after saving this form again.
rewrite_status_apache_missing#:#The Apache configuration could not be written to disk. Check that %s is writable by the web server, then save this form again.
rewrite_status_apache_onetime_instructions#:#One-time step, needed only if you have not already done it (see README): add these two lines inside your Apache vhost's Directory block for this installation, using the absolute path shown. IncludeOptional resolves a relative path against Apache's own ServerRoot, not against this directory, and fails silently if the path here is not absolute.
rewrite_status_caveat#:#This can only confirm that the configuration below was generated on disk, not that a system administrator has actually pasted it into the web server and reloaded it.
rewrite_status_nginx_detected#:#This installation appears to be served by nginx.
rewrite_status_nginx_heading#:#nginx
rewrite_status_nginx_instructions#:#Paste the block below inside the server {} block, replacing the default "location /" directive, then reload nginx (nginx -s reload).
rewrite_status_nginx_missing#:#The nginx configuration could not be written to disk. Check that %s is writable by the web server, then save this form again.
rewrite_status_nginx_not_detected#:#This installation does not appear to be served by nginx (Apache is assumed). Both configurations below are generated on every save regardless, in case this detection is wrong behind a reverse proxy.
rewrite_status_nginx_port_instructions#:#Some nginx packages set HTTP_HOST from the host name alone, dropping the port. ILIAS builds login and redirect URLs from HTTP_HOST, so on a non-default port those URLs lose it. Add the line below to your php-fpm location block, after include fastcgi_params, then reload nginx.
